  - sentence: '"My dear old friend, I would like to give you my deepest gratitude
      for being a successor of my passion project."'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: '"As I don''t have any time left because of old age, and further delving
      myself with this project can only stain my name due to it''s ethical concerns."'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: '"I commend you well for your recent progress, and I would like to
      say that you must deliver the subject to me as soon as you done enchancing
      her."'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: '"As always, keep the errand and my gratitude a secret until it''s
      time to present her to the Foundation."'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: '"Burn this paper if you must, and remember your contract." - Mr. Wundt'
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: ...
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: I have to know what's this about.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  isInteractable: 1
  isRepeatable: 0
  onlyShownOnce: 0
  isCutscene: 0
  isPuzzleDialogue: 0
