    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: Not even all of the keys I currently have would fit there.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: I don't think even hitting this thing with a hammer would break up
      either.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
  - sentence: It's elongated, which means I may need a longer key, I wonder how to
      get one.
    cutsceneImage: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    methodCall:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    disableTextSpecificDelays: 0
